{"id":"96ccbb39b5f81246","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-montel.md","title":"Montel Space","display":"df-montel — Montel Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-montel","aliases":["58-df-montel"],"display":"df-montel — Montel Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-barrelled]]","[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-montel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-montel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-montel — Montel Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7d979873300d8d4\" href=\"?note=e7d979873300d8d4\" title=\"58-df-barrelled\">58-df-barrelled</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space\">58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset\">58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V\\)</span> (locally convex space data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\\)</span> (typed locally-convex-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> (Hausdorff-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S\\)</span> (typed barrelled-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7d979873300d8d4\" href=\"?note=e7d979873300d8d4\" title=\"58-df-barrelled\">58-df-barrelled</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\)</span> (closed- and compact-subset predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MontelSpace}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{MontelSpace}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (Montel-space predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}montel} \\vdash \\mathrm{MontelSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl[\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(0_X\\in U\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(r\\leq|\\lambda|\\to B\\subseteq\\{\\lambda\\cdot_Xu:u\\in U\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\!\\left(\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq X:B\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\},X,\\tau\\right)\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}montel} \\vdash \\mathrm{MontelSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl[\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(0_X\\in U\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(r\\leq|\\lambda|\\to B\\subseteq\\{\\lambda\\cdot_Xu:u\\in U\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\!\\left(\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq X:B\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\},X,\\tau\\right)\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The locally convex operations, Hausdorff topology, barrelledness, topological-vector-space boundedness, and compact closure all use the same explicit structure parameters.</li>\n<li>Hence every closed bounded subset is compact.</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{H}(\\mathbb{C})\">\\(\\mathcal{H}(\\mathbb{C})\\)</span> (entire functions), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{D}(\\mathbb{R}^n)\">\\(\\mathcal{D}(\\mathbb{R}^n)\\)</span> (test functions).</li>\n<li>Montel spaces are reflexive under the standard convention, but need not be separable.</li>\n<li>In a nonmetrizable locally convex space, relative compactness cannot in general be replaced by the assertion that every bounded sequence has a convergent subsequence.</li>\n<li>Montel's theorem: normal families of holomorphic functions are relatively compact.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-barrelled","status":"resolved","id":"e7d979873300d8d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-barrelled]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"69f8a4b0afb36176","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-barrelled","status":"resolved","id":"e7d979873300d8d4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S$ (typed barrelled-space predicate, see [[58-df-barrelled]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MontelSpace}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}montel} \\vdash \\mathrm{MontelSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Barrelled}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl[\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(0_X\\in U\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(r\\leq|\\lambda|\\to B\\subseteq\\{\\lambda\\cdot_Xu:u\\in U\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\!\\left(\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq X:B\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\},X,\\tau\\right)\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{H}(\\mathbb{C})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{D}(\\mathbb{R}^n)","display":false}],"bytes":2279,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-859","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-montel.md|58-df-montel]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["e7d979873300d8d4","7d71608bc30daeda","69f8a4b0afb36176","4dc8b2d2e69010a2","67cf48a2f6e27861"]}